<<autism-unmask "Flats Poppy Bathroom">>
<<autism-focus "Flats Poppy Bathroom">>
<<autism-compose "Flats Poppy Bathroom">>
<<bathroomicon "toothbrush">><<link [[양치한다 (0:05)|Flats Poppy Brush Teeth]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
